ncellable contracts where the Company receives a fixed monthly fee in exchange for a series of distinct services that are substantially the same and have the same pattern of transfer over time, with the corresponding remaining performance obligations as of December 31, 2025 (Successor) in each of the future periods below:","context":"Transaction Price Allocated to the Remaining Performance Obligations","section":"Segment Reporting","block":980,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-037421","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-31","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001839530","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1839530/000110465926037421/xbp-20251231x10k.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/68307f886011fcec88dafb6306bd3166c3fc84e17ef518939fca85eae617a251.bin","sha256":"68307f886011fcec88dafb6306bd3166c3fc84e17ef518939fca85eae617a251"}},{"id":"a5c34e127cbe6c7d4c6eb2a12703b876c7cb1cae4c3dd83385c6232bbe5e516d","quote":"| | | Estimated Remaining Fixed Consideration for UnsatisfiedPerformance Obligations | ​ ​ ​ | | 2026 | | $ | 13,900 2027 | | | 8,437 2028 | | | 4,401 2029 | | | 1,084 2030 | | | 860 2031 and thereafter | | | 2,855 Total | | $ | 31,537","context":"In accordance with optional exemptions available under GAAP, the Company does not disclose the value of unsatisfied performance obligations for (a) contracts with an original expected length of one year or less, and (b) contracts for which variable consideration relates entirely to an unsatisfied performance obligation, which comprise the majority of the Company’s contracts. The Company has certain non-cancellable contracts where the Company receives a fixed monthly fee in exchange for a series of distinct services that are substantially the same and have the same pattern of transfer over time, with the corresponding remaining performance obligations as of December 31, 2025 (Successor) in each of the future periods